          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "1.4 The Statistics Wing, called National Statistics Office (NSO), coordinates the statistical activities in"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "the country and is responsible for evolving and laying, down statistical standards. India is subscriber to the"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "International Monetary Fund’s (IMF) Special Data Dissemination Standards (SDDS) and is currently"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "fulfilling the Standards. The Ministry maintains an ‘Advance Release Calendar’ for its data categories"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "covered under the SDDS, which is disseminated on the Ministry’s website as well as on the Dissemination"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "Standards Bulletin Board (DSBB) of the IMF. The Ministry releases the datasets covered under the Real"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "Sector of SDDS through press notes and its website simultaneously. India has strong system of official"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "statistics and is among the leading countries in the area of official statistics. The Ministry’s officials have been"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "associated with international agencies on the development of methodologies, particularly in the areas of"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            50,
            100,
            950,
            900
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "confidence": 0.5,
          "text": "Annual Report 2025-26\nChapter 1\nIntroduction\n1.1 The Ministry of Statistics and Programme Implementation (MoSPI) came into existence as an\nindependent Ministry on 15th October 1999 after the merger of"
