          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "Ministry’s officials in international meetings on these subjects has been highly appreciated."
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "1.8 International Comparison Programme (ICP) is the largest statistical initiative in the world under the"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "aegis of United Nations Statistics Division (UNSD). The World Bank is implementing this programme at"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "global level and Asian Development Bank (ADB) is the nodal implementing agency at Asia and the Pacific"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "Region. The main objectives of ICP are to produce Purchasing Power Parities (PPPs) and Price Level Indices"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "and to convert volume and per capita measures of GDP into common currencies using PPPs. The World Bank"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            0,
            0,
            1000,
            50
          ],
          "type": "heading",
          "confidence": 0.6,
          "text": "released the report of ICP 2021 cycle in August, 2025, which included data for India. According to these"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
